WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.350
Did you hear something?

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:38.550
No, I told you they were downtown tonight.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:45.150
Now help me get this thing out of here.

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:18.210
Alright, see if there's anything else you
can get.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:42.900
Easy boy...

00:01:49.869 --> 00:01:52.169
Action.

